            <div xml:id="d263">

                <pb facs="0319" n="311" sameAs="frus:frus1941v03/pg311"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">841.24/595: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the
                        United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-06-25T00:00:00-04:00">June 25,
                        1941—midnight</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2294. From Hopkins. Your 2572<anchor n="51" xml:id="d263-f1"/> regarding
                    shipments of articles for civilian consumption referred to your cable June 20th
                    President consents to such methods of distribution as deemed most practicable by
                    you. [Hopkins.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
